## Required fields preflight checks for

- [ ] Final-model bundle path is named.
- [ ] Structures-tried section has ≥1 entry.
- [ ] "Most painful absence" is filled in (not the literal placeholder).
- [ ] "Surprising thing" is filled in.
- [ ] Process deviations either lists ≥1 skip or says "no defaults skipped".
